WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
Hello, everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome back

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.240
to Little Nightmares.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.900
So we just escaped from the kitchen,

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.920
which means that chefs are going to be very mad at me,

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.260
and I don't know where I am. (You never know where you are Mark)

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:11.300
Now.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.940
Is that a machine in the background?

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.120
[Disbelief]: Oh, is that the sun!?

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.040
[Unsure]: Good???

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.960
Or is that just a giant spotlight?

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:21.340
Okay.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.880
Oh, no, that's the sun!

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:23.960
Maybe...

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.200
I don't wanna jump to any conclusions here because

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:26.740
I still-

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.760
We- we might either be on a boat or underwater

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.460
and I almost went right into the drink there.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.220
O-kay.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.280
How 'bout you grab onto that?

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.000
You know, any day now- There we go.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.300
