00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:37.820
I just love this scenery in this game!

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.620
It's so expansive and detailed!

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.380
Like, just the water running down the...

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:42.640
Why-?

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:43.400
Okay.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:44.780
Alright then,

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.540
OH, we're shaking now...

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.080
