00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.400
We WERE on a boat!

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.120
We WERE!

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:02.460
We WAS were! (We also speak the English good!)

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.000
Oh my God!

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.160
Ooh!

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:06.480
But...

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:07.840
WHY though?!

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:10.680
Maybe I could just jump off into the ocean

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:11.500
