00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.480
OH my GAHAhahad! (Mark has been amazed)

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.580
Oh my God, why?

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.240
But WHY though!?

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.580
WHY!?

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:23.680
Why am I go up here?!

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.280
