00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:26.780
WHY!!??

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.520
O-h, wow.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:29.540
LIKES,

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:30.040
Buh-

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.660
You know, I guess this is not too much of a surprise

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:34.500
