00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:46.820
HI, how's it going!?

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:48.000
You're a BIG seagull. (That's what she said)

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:48.580
Er, a-

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.380
Again, maybe I'm a small person, but-

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:52.840
